  "question": {
    "text": "The mechanism of action of &quot;Terfenadine&quot; (Seldane) is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Activates the histamine receptor",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Inhibits the secretion of histamine",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Helps in the secretion of histamine",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Inhibits the action of histamine receptor",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Seldane act as antihistamines and interfere with the natural action of histamine by competing with histamine for binding sites of receptor.&nbsp;"
  }
